data: {"id": "e9719b108b194e6b-thinking-parallel_evidence-611", "run_id": "e9719b108b194e6b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据 pre-react 基线结果，日志中已经出现明确的应用启动失败原文（`File \"<string>\", line 1, in <module>` 和 `from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())`），结合 Prometheus 中 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff` 和 `last_terminated_reason=Error`，说明 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，退出原因是应用启动时读取 `/input/app.conf` 失败（很可能是文件不存在）。\n\n现在执行 Kubernetes 描述、YAML、previous logs 和事件查询，以确认 Exit Code、Reason、command/args 和 probe 配置。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789138377917, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

