data: {"id": "e9719b108b194e6b-final", "run_id": "e9719b108b194e6b", "seq": 1320, "ts_ms": 1789138409180, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v09/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | aiops-case-v09/workload Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning BackOff restarting failed container app` (over 41m) | 直接反映容器频繁重启导致 Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 的现象 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason: Error`, `exit_code: 1` | 确认容器上次以非零状态码异常终止，排除 OOMKilled 等系统级原因 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` | 提供资源上下文，32Mi 内存限制对于 Python 环境通常较紧，但非本次直接崩溃原因 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | `FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/input/app.conf'` | **核心根因证据**：应用代码尝试读取 `/input/app.conf` 失败并抛出致命异常 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())` | 揭示触发崩溃的具体代码行，确认应用启动流程即失败 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (label: CrashLoopBackOff) | 指标层面确认容器当前处于等待（被 Kubelet 控制重启）状态 |\n\n**证据综合分析**：\nKubernetes 层面观察到容器以 ExitCode 1 终止并伴随 BackOff 重启（证据 #1, #2, #6）；应用日志（证据 #4, #5）提供了精确的失败原因——读取配置文件 `/input/app.conf` 时发生 `FileNotFoundError`。日志中的 Python 路径 `pathlib` 调用与异常栈完全对应，证实了应用启动时的逻辑断裂。资源限制（证据 #3）在此场景下仅作为运行环境背景，未触发系统级 OOM 特征，因此日志中的 IO 错误是决定性的根因指向。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用启动命令尝试读取缺失文件 '/input/app.conf' → Python 抛出 FileNotFoundError (ExitCode 1) 异常 → Kubelet 检测到容器进程终止并触发重启策略 → Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：应用容器启动时未能找到配置文件 `/input/app.conf`，导致进程异常退出（ExitCode 1），进而被 Kubernetes 重启策略不断重试，最终表现为 CrashLoopBackOff。\n\n- **依据**：应用日志明确记录 `FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/input/app.conf'`（证据 #4），且 K8s 状态显示容器终止原因为 Error（证据 #2）。\n- **缺失信息**：输入数据中未包含 `/input` 目录的具体挂载配置来源（如 ConfigMap、Secret 或 EmptyDir），因此无法判定是挂载配置遗漏、Volume 定义错误，还是上游资源本身缺失。但这不影响“文件不存在导致应用崩溃”这一直接根因的判断。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v09/workload: 44.7s (Evidence 35.0s, RCA 9.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v09/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 73.449, "metrics": {"run_id": "e9719b108b194e6b", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 73.4547016620636, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 73454.7016620636, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 70497.1354007721, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8273.289203643799, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2616.4677143096924}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18280.988216400146, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 44746.48332595825, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10404.05011177063, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

